---
import Layout from '../../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'China Visa-Free Countries List (2026) — China Starter Guide';
const description = 'Check if your country is eligible for visa-free entry to China in 2026.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="en">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <a href="/en/prepare/visa/" class="text-sm text-brand-600 hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-4">← Visa & Entry</a>
      <div class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium tracking-wide uppercase mb-3">Entry & Visa</div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight mb-4">
        China Visa-Free Countries List (2026)
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-400">
        Want to know if you need a visa to visit China?
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Check the list below. If your country is included in China's visa-free policy, you can enter China without applying for a tourist visa in advance — for up to 30 days per entry.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Who Can Enter China Visa-Free?</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Citizens holding ordinary passports from the countries listed below can enter China without a visa for:
      </p>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-gray-700 m-0">
          <li>Tourism</li>
          <li>Business visits</li>
          <li>Family visits</li>
          <li>Short-term cultural exchanges</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4 mb-0 font-medium">
          Maximum stay: Up to 30 calendar days per visit.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Europe (40 countries)</h2>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3 font-medium">Ordinary passport holders only</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Albania</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Austria</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Belgium</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Bosnia and Herzegovina</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Bulgaria</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Croatia</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Cyprus</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Czech Republic</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Denmark</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Estonia</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Finland</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">France</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Germany</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Greece</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Hungary</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Iceland</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Ireland</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Italy</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Latvia</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Liechtenstein</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Lithuania</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Luxembourg</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Malta</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Monaco</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Montenegro</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Netherlands</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">North Macedonia</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Norway</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Poland</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Portugal</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Romania</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Russia</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Serbia</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Slovakia</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Slovenia</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Spain</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Sweden</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Switzerland</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Ukraine</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">United Kingdom</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">North America (1 country)</h2>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Canada</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Oceania (2 countries)</h2>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Australia</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">New Zealand</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Asia (9 countries)</h2>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Bahrain</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Brunei</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Japan</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Kuwait</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Malaysia*</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Oman</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Qatar</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Saudi Arabia</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Singapore*</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">South Korea</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">United Arab Emirates</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-4 mb-0">*Singapore and Malaysia: Each stay cannot exceed 30 days, with a maximum of 90 days within any 180 days.</p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">South America (3 countries)</h2>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Argentina</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Brazil</span>
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">Chile</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <div class="bg-brand-50 border-l-2 border-brand-300 pl-5 py-3 my-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-600 m-0 italic text-sm">
          <strong>Note:</strong> Policies can change. Always confirm with official government sources or the nearest Chinese embassy/consulate before traveling.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">How Long Can You Stay?</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-2">
        <strong>Simple answer:</strong> Up to 30 calendar days per visit.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <strong>How it's calculated:</strong> The count starts at midnight on the day after your arrival.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">What Do You Need to Enter Visa-Free?</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Even without a visa, you'll still need:
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✅</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 m-0">A valid passport</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">With more than 6 months remaining validity</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✅</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 m-0">Proof of onward or return travel</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">Airline tickets or itinerary (if requested)</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✅</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 m-0">Accommodation information</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">Hotel bookings or address where you'll stay (if requested)</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✅</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 m-0">Evidence of permitted purpose</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">Proof that your trip matches tourism, business, family visit, or cultural exchange</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 italic">
        <strong>Heads up:</strong> Border officers may ask to see these documents, so keep them handy.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">What If Your Country Isn't on the List?</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Don't worry — you might still have options:
      </p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <a href="/en/prepare/visa/visa-guide/" class="block p-5 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl hover:border-brand-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Option 1: 240-Hour Visa-Free Transit Policy</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">For transiting to a third country or region</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/prepare/visa/visa-guide/" class="block p-5 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl hover:border-brand-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all">
          <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Option 2: Chinese Tourist Visa (L-type)</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">Standard visa application process</p>
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Want to know more? Check out:
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-2 mb-8 not-prose">
        <a href="/en/prepare/visa/visa-guide/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">How Easy Is It to Get a Chinese Visa in 2026? →</a><br/>
        <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">China 240-Hour Visa-Free Transit Explained →</a><br/>
        <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">How to Apply for a Chinese Tourist Visa →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
